OL,3,GNEWSACollege's #5.3m SEND centre is
OL,4,A'hugely positive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #5.3m centre has opened to support
OL,7,Fpeople with special educational needs
OL,8,Fand disabilities (SEND).
OL,10,FExeter College said the
OL,11,Fstate-of-the-art RISE Centre, which
OL,12,Fstands for re-engagement, inclusion,
OL,13,Fskills and education, received the
OL,14,Ffunding from Devon County Council's
OL,15,Fsafety value and high needs block
OL,16,Fcapital funding grants.
OL,18,FThe centre near Queen Street includes
OL,19,F12 classrooms, a teaching kitchen, art
OL,20,Froom, break out spaces, care suite and
OL,21,Ftherapy room.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
