OL,3,GNEWSACollege's #5.3m SEND centre is
OL,4,A'hugely positive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoanna Webb, head of faculty for
OL,7,Ffoundation learning and inclusion at
OL,8,Fthe college, said the centre made a
OL,9,F"hugely positive impact" on the
OL,10,Fstudents, adding "it's calm and
OL,11,Fpurposeful and creates a truly
OL,12,Finclusive learning environment".
